  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/contentPages/0",
    "raw": "<Translation: We've discovered a new race that is unlike any we've seen before. They are savage and primitive, far from being capable of posing a threat to the empire. They don't even have a civilization yet. These plant-things wander about in a near constant state of hunger.>",
    "value": "<译文：我等发现一新种族，迥异于往昔所见。此族野蛮原始，远不足为帝国之患，甚未开文明。此等植形之物几近恒久饥馑，四处游荡。>"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/contentPages/1",
    "raw": "<We continue to monitor these plant-things, and are convinced that they are unable to develop keen intellect without some form of aid. As such, the Overlords have declared them unremarkable. This means exploitation of their world, rather than non-interference, can begin.>",
    "value": "<我等将持续监视此等植形之物，确信若无外力相助，此族断难开智。故霸君宣判其不足为道。此意味可着手开发其世界，无需再守不干涉之约。>"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/contentPages/2",
    "raw": "<Interestingly enough, the plant-things are *delicious*. While our own native vegetation is tasty, these bipedal creatures are like a dessert platter. Imagine the most tasty Yulashk you've ever eaten. It's better than that. Note however, that flavor is lost if they are deceased. Enjoy the taste while they are alive.>",
    "value": "<有趣的是，此等植形之物竟美味异常。虽我族本土植被亦属可口，然此双足生灵犹如甜品之宴。试想你所尝尤拉什克之至味，犹胜其鲜。但需谨记：若其死亡，风味尽失。故请趁其鲜活，尽享其味。>"
  }
